          "text": "2005年夏 · 重庆老街 林记火锅"
        },
        {
          "start": 3.0,
          "end": 7.6,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "林双双",
          "text": "把你叶家清润汤剩下几味草本补全，咱俩婚约算完了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-1-02",
      "studioShotId": "58d609a8-70b0-4a75-b577-a6280f5cc730",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-1-02/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.25,
          "end": 5.4,
          "kind": "vo",
          "speaker": "叶寻",
          "text": "重回2005年？前世我交出祖传秘方，反被他们榨干赶出老街！"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.1,
          "end": 11.4,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "楚南",
          "text": "双双马上进我楚氏餐饮当主管，能嫁你个满身牛油味的伙夫？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-1-03",
      "studioShotId": "0c6895eb-227a-4a29-856c-2e0645833c92",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-1-03/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 4.0,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "林有才",
          "text": "白吃我家四年，留张方子抵恩，是你的本分！"
        },
        {
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 13.3,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "林双双",
          "text": "叶寻你疯了！敢撕我家的方子？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-1-04",
      "studioShotId": "b4944e0f-b187-4056-8892-e2cdc886a41a",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-1-04/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 4.2,
          "kind": "caption",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "邮政汇款存根（共48张 · 四年大学学费生活费）"
        },
        {
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 9.1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "叶寻",
          "text": "我辍学熬四年牛油，四十八张汇款单供你读完大学，两清了！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-1-05",
      "studioShotId": "f6e83caf-df03-4254-ac5f-8d51137bc2f8",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-1-05/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 1.0,
          "end": 4.3,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "叶寻",
          "text": "今晚起火我撤了，看你们拿什么端上桌！"
        },
        {
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 8.2,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "林有才",
          "text": "忘恩负义的东西！离了林记，这条街谁敢要你？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-2-01",
      "studioShotId": "bcb2a151-88a2-45f6-a27d-1be2660a1e9d",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-2-01/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.25,
          "end": 5.4,
          "kind": "vo",
          "speaker": "叶寻",
          "text": "前世只有世交芊芊护我到底，这辈子换我撑起夏记！"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.6,
          "end": 12.9,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "夏芊芊",
          "text": "叶爷爷熬汤真传我从小看着！林家瞎了眼，夏记迎你掌勺！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-2-02",
      "studioShotId": "11744166-abaa-4cb1-a375-514553383ca3",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-2-02/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 3.8,
          "kind": "caption",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "合营契书：叶夏合营 · 五五分账"
        },
        {
          "start": 4.6,
          "end": 8.6,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "夏芊芊",
          "text": "五五分账，往后咱俩一口锅里搅马勺！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-2-03",
      "studioShotId": "cdffc296-4ff5-4533-b7cf-333b319f4be1",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-2-03/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 6.2,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "楚南",
          "text": "夏芊芊，敢收他？明早断你夏记全部成品牛油，看你拿什么交房租！"
        },
        {
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 13.6,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "林双双",
          "text": "你们备好菜的机械厂十二桌席，周厂长刚改签给林记了！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-2-04",
      "studioShotId": "e83f3bf0-78a5-4671-a398-ea4bf4fe230d",
      "video": "/home/zhongwenyu/project/ai-director-train/productions/2005_chongqing_hotpot_v3/ep01_02_video_gen/takes_ep01/1-2-04/video.mp4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 3.3,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "夏芊芊",
          "text": "成品牛油全断了，明早拿什么开火？"
        },
        {
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 7.9,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "叶寻",
          "text": "不用陈年老油！坐稳，去屠宰场抢今晚头刀鲜牛板油！"
        },
        {
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 9.9,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "夏芊芊",
          "text": "走！我跟你去！"
        }
      ]
    }
